# Repository publication guard
#
# This repository intentionally publishes the current tested demo projects.
# Future production/client projects are ignored by default. To publish a new
# demo, explicitly allowlist that project folder here after review.
codex/projects/*
!codex/projects/ai-tool-cost-benchmark/
!codex/projects/ai-tool-cost-benchmark/**
!codex/projects/ai-2030-three-futures/
!codex/projects/ai-2030-three-futures/**

codex-pi/projects/*
!codex-pi/projects/gpt-image-2-quota-research/
!codex-pi/projects/gpt-image-2-quota-research/**

pi/projects/*
!pi/projects/latest-tts-voice-clone-research/
!pi/projects/latest-tts-voice-clone-research/**

claude/projects/*
!claude/projects/.gitkeep
!claude/projects/storyboard-to-video-pipeline-demo/
!claude/projects/storyboard-to-video-pipeline-demo/**
!claude/projects/block-vocabulary-reference/
!claude/projects/block-vocabulary-reference/**
!claude/projects/measurable-vs-audible-tts/
!claude/projects/measurable-vs-audible-tts/**

# tts-bakeoff-2026-08: method, samples and measurements are published; the 16 generated
# clips are not (they rebuild from data/bakeoff.json with `npm run bakeoff`).
!claude/projects/tts-bakeoff-2026-08/
!claude/projects/tts-bakeoff-2026-08/**
claude/projects/tts-bakeoff-2026-08/assets/audio/*.mp3
claude/projects/tts-bakeoff-2026-08/assets/audio/*.wav
claude/projects/tts-bakeoff-2026-08/assets/audio/*.txt
claude/projects/tts-bakeoff-2026-08/assets/audio/*.words.json

# Dependencies
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# Local auth / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/auth.json
**/*token*
**/*secret*

# Pi local cache and generated image cache
.pi/
.pi/tmp/
.pi/cache/

# Generated review kits and snapshot frames (rebuild with `hf review`)
**/review/
**/bakeoff/
**/snapshots/
**/.hf-review-tmp/
**/.hf-locale-work/

# HyperFrames transient render/cache outputs
**/renders/work-*/
**/renders/tmp-*/
**/capture/
**/.hyperframes-cache/
**/.waveform-cache/
**/.thumbnails/

# Renders: the four 2026-06 demo MP4s stay in history; new renders go to GitHub Releases.
**/renders/*.mp4
!codex/projects/ai-tool-cost-benchmark/renders/*.mp4
!codex/projects/ai-2030-three-futures/renders/*.mp4
!pi/projects/latest-tts-voice-clone-research/renders/*.mp4
# Local MCP tool descriptor cache generated by agent harnesses
mcps/
